  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini, beetroot and carrot into fries.\n• Cut sweet potato and potato into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977aad15aa7b407b7519d/step-50cb6000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place potato wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over sesame seeds (see ingredients), season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. Little cooks: Help with sprinkling over the sesame seeds and tossing the wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977aad15aa7b407b7519d/step-05d64d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977aad15aa7b407b7519d/step-4d432c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide plant-based crumbed chicken and rainbow veggie fries between plates.\n• Serve with creamy pesto dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977aad15aa7b407b7519d/step-13e68830.jpg"
    }
  ]
